WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Bundled sample: reviewed tooth segments, with a projected stage timeline.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:07.517
Select a crown or its FDI number below the viewer. Amber marks the selected tooth.

00:00:07.517 --> 00:00:14.517
Ask for an explicit geometric change. The local helper needs no API key. Processing time shortened in this video.

00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:17.048
Inspect the proposal, then Apply or Discard. It has not changed the saved working plan yet.

00:00:17.048 --> 00:00:27.663
Drag through each stage and its projected weeks. Current returns to the original scan.

00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:30.352
Use Undo to restore the prior plan. This is a geometric preview, not a predicted treatment outcome.
